<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.9" extension="2014-06-09"/>
    <code code="51847-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation + Plan note"/>
    <title>Assessment and Plan</title>
    <text><list listType="ordered"><item><content styleCode="Bold">Preventive health visit completed</content>. Health risk assessment reviewed and a personalized prevention plan made. His main risks are his depression and anxiety, now improving, and the functional seizures in treatment. Tetanus booster due. [S]<list><item>Next preventive visit in one year.</item></list></item><item><content styleCode="Bold">Major depressive disorder, single episode, moderate (F32.1)</content>. PHQ-9 8, down from 13, five weeks into sertraline 50 mg and seven sessions into psychotherapy; tolerating it; no suicidal thoughts. [S]<list><item>Continue sertraline 50 mg and psychotherapy.</item><item>Safety plan, 988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline, and clinic number confirmed; rifle remains locked.</item></list></item><item><content styleCode="Bold">Functional/dissociative seizures (F44.5)</content>. Two brief events in five weeks, fewer than before; using his grounding steps. [S]<list><item>Continue psychotherapy and the event diary; no driving yet.</item></list></item></list><paragraph>Personalized prevention plan. A written copy was given to the patient. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Status</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tetanus, diphtheria, and pertussis booster</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Tdap given today; adolescent dose eleven years ago</td></tr><tr><td>HPV vaccine</td><td>Up to date</td><td>Two-dose series completed at 12</td></tr><tr><td>Meningococcal B vaccine</td><td>Declined</td><td>Shared decision at 16 to 23 discussed; no college residence or outbreak risk; he declined</td></tr><tr><td>Influenza and COVID-19 vaccines</td><td>Due</td><td>Due when this season&apos;s vaccines arrive in the autumn</td></tr><tr><td>Depression screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>PHQ-9 8 while under treatment</td></tr><tr><td>Anxiety screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Generalized anxiety disorder under treatment; reviewed today</td></tr><tr><td>HIV screening</td><td>Ordered</td><td>One-time test at 15 to 65; never tested; ordered today</td></tr><tr><td>Hepatitis C screening</td><td>Ordered</td><td>One-time test at 18 to 79; ordered today</td></tr><tr><td>Hepatitis B screening</td><td>Ordered</td><td>One-time triple panel for all adults; ordered today</td></tr><tr><td>Blood pressure screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>114/72 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td>Unhealthy alcohol and drug use screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>AUDIT-C 1; no drug use</td></tr><tr><td>Tobacco use</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Never smoker</td></tr><tr><td>Skin cancer prevention counseling</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Fair skin; sun protection advised</td></tr><tr><td>Lipid screening</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>Age 23 with no cardiovascular risk factors</td></tr><tr><td>Sexually transmitted infection screening</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>Not sexually active in the past year; no risk factors</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>Immunizations given today: Tdap vaccine, adult booster [S]</paragraph><paragraph>Guideline basis: CMID: Clinical Monitoring Intelligence Database, depression, bipolar, and mood disorders monograph (2026); VA/DoD Clinical Practice Guideline for Assessment and Management of Patients at Risk for Suicide (2024); Medicare Preventive Services reference: visit templates, screening cascades, and documentation elements (2026); Adult Immunization Schedule by Age (2026); Depression and Suicide Risk in Adults: Screening (2023); Anxiety Disorders in Adults: Screening (2023); Human Immunodeficiency Virus (HIV) Infection: Screening (2019); Hepatitis C Virus Infection in Adolescents and Adults: Screening (2020); Screening and Testing for Hepatitis B Virus Infection: CDC Recommendations, United States, 2023 (2023); Unhealthy Drug Use: Screening (2020); Hypertension in Adults: Screening (2021)</paragraph><paragraph>Follow-up: Results by message; three-month review as booked; influenza and COVID-19 vaccines in the autumn. Next scheduled visit 2026-09-24: three-month review after completing psychotherapy: events, mood, driving, and his studies. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.21" extension="2015-08-01"/>
    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with his consent. He has no directive. He names a close friend from college as his health care agent and took the state form. He would want full treatment for any illness he might recover from. He asked that information about his functional seizures be shared only with his care team and, in an emergency, with his agent, so that he is not given emergency antiseizure medicine for a typical event. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
